<title>USA: Clinton to sign budget, tax bills on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Clinton to sign budget, tax bills on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton intends to sign the  budget and tax bills passed by Congress during a White House ceremony  at 11 a.m. on Tuesday, White House Press Secretary Mike McCurry said  Friday.</p>
<p>Congressional leaders, including House Speaker Newt Gingrich and Senate  Republican leader Trent Lott, have been invited to attend the ceremony,  the White House said.</p>
</text>
